<title>USA: Elbit holders approve de-merger.</title>
<headline>Elbit holders approve de-merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elbit Ltd said on Thursday shareholders approved the company's de-merger plan.</p>
<p>According to the plan, each shareholder will receive two additional shares, one in Elbit Systems Ltd and the other in Elbit Medical Imaging Ltd.  Part of the Company's activities will be transferred to the two new companies. Elbit Systems will concentrate on defense systems and Elbit Medical will concentrate on medical imaging and medical centers.</p>
<p>Completion of the demerger will be made according to a court order and subject to receipt of the various permits and authorizations, including the permit to register the shares of the two demerged companies for trade on the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange and on the Nasdaq National Market in the United States, the comapny said.</p>
</text>
